## Purpose

This diagram illustrates the lifecycle of a Booking after it has been confirmed.

It identifies the primary business activities and supporting entities required to prepare, manage, deliver and complete a customer's booking.

The diagram focuses on the Booking as the central business entity and demonstrates how surrounding business domains contribute to the successful delivery of a tour.

---

